00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:20.807
I think it's around Thursday.

00:00:20.807 --> 00:00:21.640
- Well, here's the thing.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.473
No, here's the thing.

00:00:22.473 --> 00:00:25.280
In fairness, we talked
about this recently,

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.750
and she said I have to
come up with a tattoo

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.830
