00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.260
It's very addictive.
- [Jurnee] It's addictive.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.010
- But it's kinda cool to
get a tattoo from her.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.140
